{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04626","headline":"奉和圣制同玉真公主过大哥山池题石壁应制 · 张说","name":"奉和圣制同玉真公主过大哥山池题石壁应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绿竹初成苑，丹砂欲化金。\n乘龙与骖凤，歌吹满山林。\n爽气凝情逈，寒光映浦深。\n忘忧题此观，爲乐赏同心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04626.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04626","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}